ean proof of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-real-form"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-real-form"],"id":"long.thm-real-form","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 5.15 (Real (non-integer) form of the quotient identity)","locator":"Long record Theorem 5.15, p. 42, label thm:real-form","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $x_d := 1/(2^d-1)$ and define the constant\n$$\nC \\;:=\\; \\sum_{d \\ge 2} x_d \\;-\\; \\tfrac12 \\;=\\; E - \\tfrac32 \\;=\\; 0.1066951524152917\\ldots,\n$$\nwhere $E$ is the Erdős–Borwein constant. Then, for every quotient row $n \\ge 6$,\n$$\n\n\\Delta_n \\;=\\; 4^n \\Big( \\sum_{d \\in \\mathrm{Skip}_n} x_d \\;-\\; C \\Big) \\;+\\; \\eta_n, \\qquad\n|\\eta_n| < 2n+2.\n\\tag{II}\n$$\n**Proof.** Splitting the full series at $n$ gives\n$$\n\\eta_n=4^nR_{n-1}-2^{n+1}\n       +\\sum_{d\\in D_n}\\left\\{\\frac{4^n}{2^d-1}\\right\\}.\n$$\nThe tail bounds $2^{-(n-1)}<R_{n-1}\\le\n2^{-(n-1)}+\\tfrac23 4^{-(n-1)}$ and $|D_n|\\le n-2$ show $0<\\eta_n<n+2/3<2n+2$.*\n\n***Use of the error bound.** For $H>2n+2$, the condition $|\\sum_{d\\in\\mathrm{Skip}_n}x_d-C|>(H+2n+2)/4^n$ is sufficient for $|\\Delta_n|>H$. Conversely, $|\\Delta_n|>H$ implies $|\\sum_{d\\in\\mathrm{Skip}_n}x_d-C|>(H-2n-2)/4^n$. Thus a square-root-exponential deviation corresponds to a separation of order $2^{-3n/2}$, with the displayed additive error retained. This is not an exact equivalence after simply discarding that error.\\\n**Note:** $C = E - 3/2$ is Mersenne-specific, but the shape “scaled deviation $=$ $4^n \\cdot$(finite skip-sum $-$ target constant) $+ O(n)$” is a template, not yet matched to any analogous constant on the \\#249 side.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-real-form","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_margins%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real